# <type>(<optional scope>): <summary, usually lower case, no period>
# Keep the subject short (usually well under 100 chars), e.g.
#   fix(backfill): retry a window that hit the result cap
# Scopes in use: astro (the web/ site), cli, backfill.
#
#   feat     : new behavior
#   fix      : bug fix
#   refactor : restructure without changing behavior
#   docs     : documentation and comments only
#   test     : tests only
#   ci       : GitHub Actions workflows
#   chore    : tooling, dependencies, housekeeping
#   data     : docs/*.json changes (backfills, cleanups)

# Blank line, then the body: what changed and why, wrapped at 72 chars.
# Keep it self-contained; reference only this repo's public issues and PRs.
